{"answer":null,"concept_id":"gemm-epilogue-bandwidth","content_sha256":"sha256:0745f99e674ac708eea7bf6d4fa58d470882e9b9ff983a0a9dd9c77c545dd3a6","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789365708.130972,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"接到 EVT/融合变慢题：主循环好 ≠ 整核好。","id":"q-operator-gemm-epilogue-store-bound-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"epilogue：把累加器写回 HBM、bias/激活/量化。小 M/N 或未融合的逐元素尾部会变成带宽瓶颈。对策是 EVT/融合或把尾部藏进 C 的 store 流水，而不是再加大 MMA tile"},{"id":"b","text":"一定是 occupancy 不够，再加 block"},{"id":"c","text":"MMA 高说明整核已最优，剩下是测量误差"},{"id":"d","text":"应改成 FP64 提高强度"}],"prompt":"主循环 MMA pipe 已经很高，但 GEMM kernel 仍明显慢于峰值。更该查哪一段？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"CUTLASS / CuTe overview","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cutlass/latest/overview.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"gemm","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
